config NFC_EMUL
	bool "Emulated NFC controller"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_ZEPHYR_NFC_EMUL_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable the emulated NFC controller. This is a fake driver in that it
	  does not talk to real hardware; exchanges are driven by a script the
	  application supplies. It is used to test the NFC driver API on a host
	  build.
